      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a good start but it feels a bit generic. can you actually draft the full memo? specifically, i want you to include a section on how we identify \"inappropriate discourse.\" i'm worried about certain political topics or symbols that might make people feel unsafe or excluded. can you flesh out which types of expression we should probably restrict to maintain that inclusive environment?",
